WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,520 --> 00:00:03,320
Wife, do you like your daughter?

2
00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:04,760
Xiao Fan is not well yet

3
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:07,080
We've already caused a lot of trouble to the big boss and them.

4
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:09,800
You can't expose yourself lightly and let your bodyguard do it all

5
00:00:10,320 --> 00:00:13,680
Okay, be careful yourself

6
00:00:16,620 --> 00:00:17,700
I'll go with Brother Liu

7
00:00:17,980 --> 00:00:20,420
Multiple people and multiple caregivers are not enough

8
00:00:20,940 --> 00:00:23,500
Why do you, a little girl, do this kind of work?

9
00:00:23,860 --> 00:00:26,140
I don’t know what happened before, I can’t say for sure.

10
00:00:27,260 --> 00:00:28,460
You guys are always waiting in the car anyway

11
00:00:29,180 --> 00:00:30,260
Work regardless of gender

12
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:31,860
It would be more dangerous for Brother Liu to go there alone

13
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:34,460
I can take care of things when I'm around

14
00:00:35,060 --> 00:00:37,260
When others see us there are two of us, they don’t dare to mess around.

15
00:00:38,490 --> 00:00:41,650
Wang Limin, it’s safer for you to take your children to the bus side.

16
00:00:42,580 --> 00:00:44,100
You guard the SUV, don't let others chariot
